**SAROJ NEPALI**

🏗️ Civil Engineering | 📐 CAD & Facilities Planning | 💻 Computer Science | 📊 Data Science

Building the bridge between the built environment and data-driven technology.

I'm a multidisciplinary engineering and technology professional with experience spanning Civil Engineering, building design, construction, surveying, CAD, and facilities planning, combined with a B.S. in Computer Science and my current journey into Data Science.

I currently work as a Senior CAD Technician in Facilities Planning at Roswell Park Comprehensive Cancer Center in Buffalo, New York, where I work with building information, CAD documentation, campus surveys, and facility planning.

🎓 Currently pursuing: M.S. Engineering Science — Data Science, University at Buffalo

